[
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:0.1"], "en": "The Therāpadāna,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:0.2"], "en": "Buddhavagga 1.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:0.3"], "en": "Buddhaapadāna", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:1.1"], "en": "Homage to that Blessed One, the Worthy One, the Perfectly Self-Awakened One.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:2.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:2.2"], "en": "The sage of Videha, with his body bowed low, questioned the Tathāgata while he was dwelling in Jeta’s Grove.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:2.3"], "en": "“It is said that they are indeed called ‘Omniscient Buddhas’;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:2.4"], "en": "by what causes, O Hero, do they become so?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:3.1"], "en": "Then the Supreme Omniscient One, the Great Sage, replied:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:3.2"], "en": "With a sweet voice, he said, \"O Ānandabhadda,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:3.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:3.4"], "en": "those who have performed meritorious deeds under previous Buddhas but have not yet attained liberation within the teachings of the Conquerors.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:4.1"], "en": "By that very gateway to enlightenment,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:4.2"], "en": "through their noble aspiration and great strength,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:4.3"], "en": "and by the power of their wisdom, these steadfast ones possess exceedingly sharp discernment.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:4.4"], "en": "They attain the state of omniscience.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:5.1"], "en": "I too, among former Buddhas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:5.2"], "en": "aspired to Buddhahood.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:5.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:5.4"], "en": "Having become the King of Dharma through his mind alone,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:6.1"], "en": "there were then incalculable Buddha-apadānas.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:6.2"], "en": "Listen with pure minds:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:6.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:6.4"], "en": "the Dharma-kings, who have fulfilled the thirty perfections, are beyond counting.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:7.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:7.2", "PA_tha-ap_1:7.3"], "en": "Having paid homage with my ten fingers to the World-Leader together with the Saṅgha, the best of Buddhas, for the sake of supreme enlightenment;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:7.4"], "en": "I paid homage with my head.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:8.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:8.2"], "en": "Whatever jewels exist throughout the Buddha-fields, as many as can be numbered—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:8.3"], "en": "Those dwelling in the air and those dwelling on the earth—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:8.4"], "en": "I mentally brought them all there;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:9.1"], "en": "therein, upon that ground of silver,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:9.2"], "en": "I had a palace built,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:9.3"], "en": "consisting of many stories and made of jewels,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:9.4"], "en": "rising high up into the sky.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:10.1"], "en": "A well-constructed, beautifully proportioned,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:10.2"], "en": "and magnificent pillar of diverse colors,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:10.3"], "en": "with a golden outer casing.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:10.4"], "en": "Adorned with jeweled shadows,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:11.1"], "en": "the first ground is made of beryl,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:11.2"], "en": "beautiful like a cloudless sky.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:11.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:11.4"], "en": "Studded with lotuses as numerous as water-lilies upon a ground of excellent gold,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:12.1"], "en": "they have coral tips and are the color of coral.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:12.2"], "en": "A certain beautiful red glow,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:12.3"], "en": "with the hue of an *indagopaka* insect,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:12.4"], "en": "illuminates the earth and the quarters of the sky.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:13.1"], "en": "The house-entrances are well-proportioned,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:13.2"], "en": "with turrets and lion-windows;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:13.3"], "en": "there are four railings and lattices.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:13.4"], "en": "Delightful garlands of fragrance—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:14.1"], "en": "blue, yellow, red,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:14.2"], "en": "white, and pure black.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:14.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:14.4"], "en": "Adorned with excellent gabled halls and embellished with the seven precious gems,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:15.1"], "en": "there were lotuses made of radiant light.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:15.2"], "en": "Adorned with predatory birds,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:15.3"], "en": "strewn with constellations and stars,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:15.4"], "en": "and graced by the moon and sun.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:16.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:16.2"], "en": "Covered with nets of gold and joined with golden bells,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:16.3"], "en": "they resound with the force of the wind.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:16.4", "PA_tha-ap_1:17.1"], "en": "A beautiful golden garland, crimson, red,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:17.2"], "en": "yellow, and tawny-gold.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:17.3"], "en": "Adorned with garlands of raised banners and dyed with various colors—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:17.4"], "en": "though many hundreds of people [be there],", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:18.1"], "en": "they could not [overcome] it.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:18.2"], "en": "The Phalika peaks are made of silver;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:18.3"], "en": "those of Maṇi are of ruby,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:18.4"], "en": "and likewise those of Masāragalla.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:18.5"], "en": "Variegated with various patterns,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:18.6", "PA_tha-ap_1:19.1"], "en": "spread with fine Kāsika cloth; blankets, Dukūla, and Cīna fabrics.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:19.2"], "en": "Cotton cloths and white woolen rugs—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:19.3"], "en": "every kind of carpet,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:19.4"], "en": "I shall mentally arrange.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:20.1"], "en": "On each of those very levels,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:20.2"], "en": "there were lamps of *maṇi-verocana* jewels,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:20.3"], "en": "adorned with jeweled peaks.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:20.4"], "en": "They stand firm, supporting the structure.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:21.1"], "en": "The pillars shine like stakes,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:21.2"], "en": "and the golden archways are beautiful.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:21.3"], "en": "Made of the essence of Jambu-river gold,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:21.4"], "en": "and also made of silver;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:22.1"], "en": "with many joints well-proportioned.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:22.2"], "en": "The door panels were painted,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:22.3"], "en": "with many full vases on both sides,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:22.4"], "en": "adorned with lotuses and water-lilies.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:23.1"], "en": "And to all the Buddhas of the past,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:23.2"], "en": "together with the Saṅgha, the leaders of the world,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:23.3"], "en": "in their natural form and appearance—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:23.4"], "en": "Having manifested [himself] together with his disciples,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:24.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:24.2"], "en": "all the Buddhas along with their disciples entered through that very gate.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:24.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:24.4"], "en": "The noble assembly, seated upon a throne made entirely of gold—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:25.1"], "en": "both those who exist now, and...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:25.2"], "en": "The Buddhas are unsurpassed in the world;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:25.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:25.4"], "en": "both those of the past and those of the present have all ascended to that state.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:26.1"], "en": "To the many hundreds of Paccekabuddhas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:26.2"], "en": "the Self-Existent Ones who are unconquered,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:26.3"], "en": "both in the past and in the present.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:26.4"], "en": "All ascended to the state of meditation.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:27.1"], "en": "There are many wish-fulfilling trees,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:27.2"], "en": "both those of the devas and those of humans.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:27.3"], "en": "Having gathered all the cloth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:27.4"], "en": "I provide the three robes;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:28.1"], "en": "I offer food to be chewed, food to be eaten, and food to be swallowed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:28.2", "PA_tha-ap_1:28.3"], "en": "Having filled beautiful bowls made of jewels with excellent food and drink,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:28.4"], "en": "I gave them away.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:29.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:29.2"], "en": "Having become like divine garments, smooth and joined with robes,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:29.3"], "en": "they were sweet and like sugar.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:29.4"], "en": "And ghee and honey-syrup—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:30.1"], "en": "having been satisfied with this supreme food,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:30.2"], "en": "they all belong to the circle of the Noble Ones.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:30.3"], "en": "Having entered the jewel-chamber,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:30.4"], "en": "like a lion dwelling in its cave,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:31.1"], "en": "[he sat] upon a most noble couch.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:31.2"], "en": "They assumed the lion’s posture;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:31.3"], "en": "being fully aware,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:31.4"], "en": "they rose from their beds and sat cross-legged upon them.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:32.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:32.2", "PA_tha-ap_1:32.3"], "en": "Established in the delight of jhāna, they teach other dharmas that are the domain of all Buddhas.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:32.4"], "en": "Some play with psychic powers;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:33.1"], "en": "others apply themselves to the higher knowledges,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:33.2"], "en": "having mastered the higher knowledges.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:33.3"], "en": "They perform transformations,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:33.4"], "en": "many thousands in number;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:34.1"], "en": "even Buddhas question Buddhas.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:34.2"], "en": "The object that is the abode of the Omniscient One—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:34.3"], "en": "this profound and subtle state—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:34.4"], "en": "they awaken to through wisdom.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:35.1"], "en": "The disciples question the Buddha,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:35.2"], "en": "and the Buddhas question the disciples;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:35.3"], "en": "having questioned one another, they—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:35.4"], "en": "They explain it to one another:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:36.1"], "en": "the Buddhas, the Paccekabuddhas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:36.2"], "en": "the disciples, and the attendants.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:36.3"], "en": "Thus, with their own delight,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:36.4"], "en": "they take pleasure in the palace.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:37.1"], "en": "Let the jeweled parasols remain!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:37.2"], "en": "With golden tassel-ends,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:37.3"], "en": "encircled by nets of pearls—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:37.4"], "en": "may they all be borne upon their heads.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:38.1"], "en": "Let there be cloth canopies,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:38.2"], "en": "adorned with golden stars,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:38.3"], "en": "and spread with variegated garlands.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:38.4"], "en": "May all bear it upon their heads.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:39.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:39.2"], "en": "It is adorned with spreading garlands of flowers and garlands of perfumes.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:39.3"], "en": "Encircled by garlands of cloth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:39.4"], "en": "adorned with jeweled strings,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:40.1"], "en": "strewn with flowers, and beautifully decorated.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:40.2"], "en": "Adorned with fragrant scents,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:40.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:40.4"], "en": "it was decorated with five-fingered handprints of perfume and covered with a golden canopy.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:41.1"], "en": "In the four directions of the lotus pond,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:41.2"], "en": "strewn with red and blue lotuses,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:41.3"], "en": "may golden forms appear.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:41.4"], "en": "Dust from the pollen of lotuses rises up.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:42.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:42.2"], "en": "May all the trees bloom on every side of the palace.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:42.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:42.4"], "en": "Having released the flowers themselves and gone to scatter them over his dwelling,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:43.1"], "en": "let them dance there for Sikhin.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:43.2"], "en": "Let the divine swans warble their songs;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:43.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:43.4"], "en": "let the karavīka birds and the flocks of winged creatures sing on every side.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:44.1"], "en": "Let all the kettledrums resound,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:44.2"], "en": "let all the lutes ring out their notes;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:44.3"], "en": "let all the musical ensembles proceed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:44.4"], "en": "All around the palace,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:45.1"], "en": "as far as the Buddha-field extends,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:45.2"], "en": "and beyond that, throughout the world-systems.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:45.3"], "en": "Vast, endowed with splendor,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:45.4"], "en": "unbroken, and made of jewels—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:46.1"], "en": "let these golden couches remain.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:46.2"], "en": "May your lamp-trees blaze forth;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:46.3"], "en": "may they become a single great light,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:46.4"], "en": "extending through ten thousand worlds.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:47.1"], "en": "Let courtesans, dancers,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:47.2"], "en": "and throngs of celestial nymphs appear,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:47.3"], "en": "resplendent in various colors.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:47.4"], "en": "All around the palace;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:48.1"], "en": "on the tops of trees, on mountain peaks,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:48.2"], "en": "or upon the summit of Mount Sineru.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:48.3"], "en": "I raise up every banner,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:48.4"], "en": "variegated and five-colored.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:49.1"], "en": "Men, nāgas, and gandhabbas—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:49.2"], "en": "All the gods approached you,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:49.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:49.4"], "en": "surrounding the palace while paying homage with palms joined.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:50.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:50.2"], "en": "Whatever wholesome deed, whatever action is to be done by me—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:50.3"], "en": "whether by body, speech, or mind—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:50.4"], "en": "Whatever has been well done by the Thirty-three gods—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:51.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:51.2"], "en": "those beings who possess perception and those beings who are without perception.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:51.3"], "en": "May all those for whom this merit has been performed,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:51.4", "PA_tha-ap_1:52.1"], "en": "and by whom it is well understood, become partakers of its fruit.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:52.2"], "en": "The fruit of my merit has been given;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:52.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:52.4"], "en": "and those gods who were not aware of it there went and announced it.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:53.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:53.2"], "en": "Whatever beings there are in the entire world who live for the sake of food—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:53.3"], "en": "may they all have delightful food.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:53.4"], "en": "May they receive it with their hearts.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:54.1"], "en": "With my mind I have given this gift;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:54.2"], "en": "with my mind I have brought forth serene confidence.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:54.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:54.4"], "en": "All the Perfectly Enlightened Ones, the Pacceka Buddhas, and the disciples of the Conqueror were honored;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:55.1"], "en": "by that well-performed deed,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:55.2"], "en": "And through my volition and aspiration,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:55.3"], "en": "having cast off this human body,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:55.4"], "en": "I went to the realm of the Thirty-three.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:56.1"], "en": "I know two states of existence:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:56.2"], "en": "that of a deity and that of a human;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:56.3"], "en": "I know no other destination.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:56.4"], "en": "Through the fruit of my mental aspiration,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:57.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:57.2"], "en": "may I become superior to the gods and a sovereign over men.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:57.3"], "en": "Endowed with the marks of physical beauty,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:57.4"], "en": "he shall be peerless in wisdom;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:58.1"], "en": "[he shall enjoy] various kinds of excellent food.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:58.2"], "en": "And no small amount of jewels,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:58.3"], "en": "and various garments,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:58.4"], "en": "quickly come to me from the sky.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:59.1"], "en": "Whether on the earth, on mountains,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:59.2"], "en": "in the sky, in water, or in the forest—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:59.3"], "en": "whichever way I stretch forth my hand, [I see only suffering].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:59.4"], "en": "Divine foods come to me—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:60.1"], "en": "from the earth and from mountains,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:60.2"], "en": "from the sky, from water, and from the forest.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:60.3"], "en": "Whatever hand I stretch forth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:60.4"], "en": "all kinds of jewels come to me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:61.1"], "en": "Both from the earth and from the mountains, [they come].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:61.2"], "en": "In the air, in the water, and in the forest—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:61.3"], "en": "whenever I stretch forth my hand,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:61.4"], "en": "all fragrances come to me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:62.1"], "en": "Whether on the earth, on mountains,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:62.2"], "en": "in the sky, in water, or in the forest—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:62.3"], "en": "whichever way I stretch forth my hand, [I find no refuge].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:62.4"], "en": "All vehicles come to me—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:63.1"], "en": "on the earth, on mountains,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:63.2"], "en": "in the sky, in water, and in the forest.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:63.3"], "en": "Whatever hand I stretch out,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:63.4"], "en": "all kinds of garlands come to me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:64.1"], "en": "Both from the earth and from the mountains, [they come].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:64.2"], "en": "In the sky, in the water, and in the forest—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:64.3"], "en": "whenever I stretch out my hand,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:64.4"], "en": "ornaments come to me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:65.1"], "en": "Whether on the earth, on mountains,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:65.2"], "en": "in the sky, in water, or in the forest—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:65.3"], "en": "whichever hand I stretch forth, [it is there that I find my refuge].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:65.4"], "en": "All maidens come to me—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:66.1"], "en": "from the earth and the mountains,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:66.2"], "en": "from the sky, the water, and the forest.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:66.3"], "en": "Whichever hand I stretch out,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:66.4"], "en": "honey and sugar come to me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:67.1"], "en": "Both from the earth and from the mountains, [they come].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:67.2"], "en": "In the sky, in the water, and in the forest—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:67.3"], "en": "whenever I stretch out my hand,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:67.4"], "en": "all kinds of creatures come to devour me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:68.1"], "en": "To those who are weary on their journey,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:68.2"], "en": "to beggars, and to travelers,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:68.3"], "en": "I give here this most excellent gift.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:68.4"], "en": "For the sake of attaining supreme enlightenment,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:69.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:69.2"], "en": "he made the rocky mountain resound and thundered upon the massive peak.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:69.3"], "en": "Making the world with its devas laugh,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:69.4", "PA_tha-ap_1:70.1"], "en": "I am the Buddha in the world; throughout the ten directions of the world, I am the one who brings joy.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:70.2"], "en": "There is no end to those who go;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:70.3"], "en": "and in that direction,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:70.4"], "en": "there are incalculable Buddha-fields.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:71.1"], "en": "My radiance is proclaimed,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:71.2"], "en": "borne by twin rays;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:71.3"], "en": "within this interval is a web of light.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:71.4"], "en": "May there be vast light.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:72.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:72.2"], "en": "May all people in this entire world-system see me.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:72.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:72.4"], "en": "May all follow me as far as the abode of Brahmā,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:73.1"], "en": "by means of this distinguished sound of honey.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:73.2"], "en": "I shall beat the drum of the Deathless;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:73.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:73.4"], "en": "let all people within this world hear my sweet voice.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:74.1"], "en": "As the rain falls from the cloud of Dhamma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:74.2"], "en": "may all beings become free from taints—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:74.3"], "en": "even those who are the very last of sentient beings.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:74.4"], "en": "May they become stream-enterers.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:75.1"], "en": "Having given the gift that ought to be given,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:75.2"], "en": "and having fulfilled moral conduct without exception;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:75.3"], "en": "Having reached the perfection of renunciation,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:75.4", "PA_tha-ap_1:76.1"], "en": "he attained supreme enlightenment after questioning the wise.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:76.2", "PA_tha-ap_1:76.3"], "en": "Having exerted supreme energy and having reached the perfection of patience,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:76.4"], "en": "he attained unsurpassed enlightenment.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:77.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:77.2"], "en": "Having made a firm resolve and fulfilled the perfection of truth,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:77.3"], "en": "having reached the perfection of loving-kindness,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:77.4"], "en": "He attained supreme enlightenment.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:78.1"], "en": "Regarding gain and loss, pleasure and pain,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:78.2"], "en": "honor and dishonor;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:78.3"], "en": "Having become impartial toward all things,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:78.4"], "en": "he attained supreme enlightenment;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:79.1"], "en": "seeing indolence as fear, he...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:79.2"], "en": "And also energy for security:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:79.3"], "en": "Be those who have aroused energy—", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:79.4"], "en": "this is the instruction of the Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:80.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:80.2"], "en": "Seeing dispute as fear and non-dispute as security,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:80.3"], "en": "be united and friendly.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:80.4"], "en": "This is the instruction of the Buddha:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:81.1", "PA_tha-ap_1:81.2"], "en": "seeing heedlessness as danger and heedfulness as security.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:81.3"], "en": "Cultivate the Eightfold Path;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:81.4"], "en": "this is the instruction of the Buddhas.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:82.1"], "en": "Many Buddhas have gathered together.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:82.2"], "en": "And [pay homage] to all the arahants;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:82.3", "PA_tha-ap_1:82.4"], "en": "bowing down, you should pay homage to the Perfectly Enlightened Ones and the arahants.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:83.1"], "en": "Thus inconceivable are the Buddhas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:83.2", "PA_tha-ap_1:83.3"], "en": "inconceivable are the qualities of a Buddha; for those who have faith in what is inconceivable, [the fruit is likewise inconceivable].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:83.4"], "en": "“The ripening [of kamma] is inconceivable.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:84.1"], "en": "Thus, indeed, the Blessed One, extolling his own conduct as a Buddha, spoke this Dhamma discourse named “The Deeds of the Buddhas” (*Buddhāpadāniya*).", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_1:85.1"], "en": "The *Buddhāpadāna* is completed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"}
]
